<title>USA: Platinum completes Intersound purchase.</title>
<headline>Platinum completes Intersound purchase.</headline>
<dateline>DOWNERS GROVE, Ill. 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Platinum Entertainment Inc said Monday it completed its acquisition of Intersound Inc on January 31 for about $24 million.</p>
<p>Intersound, with headquarters in George, is a large, independent record company.</p>
<p>Platinum provides recorded music for a variety of music formats.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
